[[Image:Direforge Hill.jpg|thumb|Direforge Hill]]
[[Direforge Hill]] is located in northeastern [[Wetlands]], just southeast of [[Dun Modr]]. It is typically where one can find the [[warlock]] [[Balgaras the Foul]] and several other [[dark iron dwarves]] dispersed into several smallish camps.

